# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify-style redirects.
# Lets `curl -fsSL https://localmem.org/install | sh` work the same as
# hitting the GitHub Releases install.sh URL directly. The 302 keeps
# the URL pointed at the latest release asset.

/install     https://github.com/VJ-yadav/localmem-public/releases/latest/download/install.sh   302
/install/*   https://github.com/VJ-yadav/localmem-public/releases/latest/download/install.sh   302

# Convenience shortlinks
/docs        https://github.com/VJ-yadav/localmem-public/blob/main/docs/HOW_IT_WORKS.md         302
/repo        https://github.com/VJ-yadav/localmem-public                                        302
/npm         https://www.npmjs.com/package/localmem-mcp                                          302
/issues      https://github.com/VJ-yadav/localmem-public/issues                                  302
/discussions https://github.com/VJ-yadav/localmem-public/discussions                             302
